        "intro": "<h3>Support your mouth-opening exercises with guided movement</h3><p>MARCEL® MOFlex Device is a mouth-opening support tool designed to support guided, gradual mouth-opening exercises as part of a structured rehabilitation routine for selected individuals experiencing restricted mouth opening.</p><p>It is an optional support tool, not a standalone solution, and should be used according to appropriate professional guidance.</p>",
